<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>This templated <ref refid="classHashMap16BitFixedSize" kindref="compound">HashMap16BitFixedSize</ref> class defines optimized methods for hashing and storing unique information about bundles into a fixed bucket hash map size of 2^16. </para>
</sect1>
